    {
      "id": "p0095-b008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Spiders are holding a bake sale in the underground ruins, with doughnuts and cider available for purchase. Supporting the spiders here can have an effect on later events in the game, so the bake sale isn’t a simple, unimportant shop.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.0877128,
          0.6064286,
          0.7088421,
          0.6628571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.0877128,
          0.6064286,
          0.7088421,
          0.6628571
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "蜘蛛们在地下遗迹里举办烘焙义卖，出售甜甜圈和苹果酒。在这里支持蜘蛛，会影响游戏后续的事件，因此这场义卖并不是一家无关紧要的普通小店。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.0917925,
          0.6042857,
          0.7057824,
          0.6664286
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "line_height": 1.45,
        "font_weight": 450,
        "background": "transparent",
        "text_align": "justify"
      },
      "notes": "原图与截图保留；译文为待审校初稿。",
      "calibration": {
        "bbox": [
          0.0917925,
          0.6042857,
          0.7057824,
          0.6664286
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "leading": 29.0
      },
      "annotations": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0095-b009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "There’s one problem, though: bake sales aren’t very common in Japan. The team eventually decided to localize “bake sale” as sokubaikai (“sales exhibition”), which is roughly equivalent to the “Artist Alley” vendor areas commonly seen at entertainment conventions in the West.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.0877128,
          0.6721429,
          0.7088421,
          0.7457143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.0877128,
          0.6721429,
          0.7088421,
          0.7457143
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "但有个问题：烘焙义卖在日本并不常见。团队最终决定把 bake sale本地化为 sokubaikai（即卖会），大致相当于西方娱乐展会上常见的 Artist Alley，也就是创作者摆摊售卖作品的区域。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 40,
            "end": 50,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          }
        ]
      },
